DIAGNOSTICS
  E0260: query `paged` will scan `City`: no index leads with any of (region)
  E0310: `distinct` query `paged` uses a keyset `page`
  E0311: `distinct` on aggregate query `counts` is redundant
  E0312: `distinct` query `bad_order` orders by unprojected column `name`
  W0111: `distinct` query `all` returns whole `City` rows
SCHEMA
model City  table=city
  id: Id
  name: text
  region: text
shape RegionName from City
shape RegionCount from City
query regions  target=City verb=list many  shape=RegionName
query counts  target=City verb=list many  shape=RegionCount
query paged  target=City verb=list many  shape=RegionName  page
query bad_order  target=City verb=list many  shape=RegionName
query all  target=City verb=list many
